00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:15.390
Sis...

00:22:17.970 --> 00:22:21.980
What I Wanted To Tell You

00:22:31.850 --> 00:22:35.390
<i>Without even thinking, I shouted a reply</i>

00:22:35.390 --> 00:22:42.020
<i>The voice opening that new door</i>
<i>sounded like a tightly clenched fist</i>

00:22:42.020 --> 00:22:45.430
<i>Resounding with reassuring determination</i>

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:48.810
<i>I think if I let out</i>
<i>(I've been waiting for this)</i>

00:22:48.810 --> 00:22:52.100
<i>All my pent-up energy</i>
<i>(I can change something)</i>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:58.680
<i>We've always been looking for</i>
<i>something this cool! Ain't that right?</i>

00:22:58.680 --> 00:23:01.600
<i>Feeling insecure</i>
<i>(Oh my God!)</i>

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:04.890
<i>I fell into a funk</i>
<i>(Oh my pride!)</i>

00:23:04.890 --> 00:23:06.970
<i>Send that old me</i>
<i>(Don't give in!)</i>

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:08.640
<i>A solid cheer</i>
<i>(Go, go!)</i>

00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:13.140
<i>Make encouraging motions</i>
<i>(Let's dance together!)</i>

00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:16.520
<i>Yes! Fly high, fly dive, up and away!</i>

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:20.270
<i>Never hang your head and give up</i>
<i>(No!) </i>

00:23:20.270 --> 00:23:23.600
<i>Break up, break out, break it to smithereens</i>
<i>(Yes!)</i>

00:23:23.600 --> 00:23:26.890
<i>Smile together, break a sweat, show your guts!</i>
<i>(Guts!)</i>

00:23:26.890 --> 00:23:33.520
<i>Strike a victory pose toward the blue sky</i>
<i>(Jump! Jump! High V!)</i>

00:23:33.520 --> 00:23:36.680
<i>Win over everybody's hearts!</i>

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:40.060
<i>Go for that moment when</i>
<i>you meet a sparkling smile</i>

00:23:43.390 --> 00:23:48.180
<i>Go, fight! Go, fight, win!</i>

00:23:52.560 --> 00:23:54.180
You're looking forward to it, Haru.

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:54.520
Huh?

00:23:54.520 --> 00:23:57.970
Man, I want some homemade
chocolate cake, too.

00:23:57.970 --> 00:23:59.970
D-Did you hear that from Sho?

00:23:59.970 --> 00:24:02.020
I'll probably get zero this year.

00:24:02.020 --> 00:24:05.310
No, I think you could get one.

